<title>JAPAN: Shikoku Coca-Cola - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shikoku Coca-Cola - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.96		vs	   23.28</p>
<p> Operating	    2.43		vs	    2.35</p>
<p> Current		2.69		vs	    2.68</p>
<p> Net		    1.41		vs	    1.43</p>
<p> EPS		   63.85 yen	  vs	   65.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shikoku Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a Coca-Cola bottler covering the Shikoku market.</p>
